<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TIETMEYER - CASE FOR ERM PARITY BASED EURO RATES.</title>
<headline>TIETMEYER - CASE FOR ERM PARITY BASED EURO RATES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Friday in Prague that there was a good case to be made for European conversion rates into the euro to be based on current ERM parities.</p>
</text>
